    "title": "orders-api admin settings",
    "kind": "Claude wrote this · mockup",
    "ask": "sketch what a settings screen for this API's admin panel could look like: rate limits, API keys, and a danger zone",
    "after": "I sketched a settings screen for `orders-api` with a left sidebar that switches between three sections. The controls work: the slider moves, you can add and revoke keys, and the pause button toggles. It's only a mockup; nothing is connected to the server, and the key names and \"last used\" times are made up.",
    "code": "<style>\n.set{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;gap:20px}\n.nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}\n.nav button{justify-content:flex-start;text-align:left;border:none;background:none;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:var(--border-radius-sm);color:var(--color-text-secondary)}\n.nav button.on{background:var(--color-background-tertiary);color:var(--color-text-primary);font-weight:500}\n.pane{display:none}.pane.on{display:flex}\n.f{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 150px;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border-tertiary)}\n.f:last-child{border-bottom:none}\n.k{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border-tertiary)}\n.danger{border-color:var(--color-text-danger)}\n.dz{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border-tertiary)}\n.dz:last-child{border-bottom:none}\n@media (max-width:520px){.set{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav{flex-direction:row}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"set\">\n  <div class=\"nav\">\n    <div class=\"faint\" style=\"padding:0 10px 6px\">orders-api · v0.3.1</div>\n    <button class=\"on\" data-p=\"rl\">Rate limits</button>\n    <button data-p=\"keys\">API keys</button>\n    <button data-p=\"dz\">Danger zone</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"pane stack on\" id=\"rl\">\n      <h3>Rate limits</h3>\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:4px 16px\">\n        <div class=\"f\"><div><div>Requests per minute</div><small class=\"faint\">Per API key, across all routes</small></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"10\" max=\"1000\" step=\"10\" value=\"120\" id=\"rpm\" style=\"flex:1\"><span class=\"mono\" id=\"rpmv\" style=\"width:36px;text-align:right\">120</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"f\"><div><div>Burst allowance</div><small class=\"faint\">Extra requests allowed in a 1s spike</small></div>\n          <input type=\"number\" value=\"20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"f\"><div><div>Max page size</div><small class=\"faint\"><code>?limit=</code> on <code>GET /api/orders</code></small></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><input type=\"number\" value=\"200\" style=\"flex:1\"><small class=\"faint\">default 50</small></div></div>\n        <div class=\"f\"><div><div>When exceeded</div></div>\n          <select><option>429 + Retry-After</option><option>Queue for 5s, then 429</option></select></div>\n        <div class=\"f\"><div><div>Exempt internal keys</div></div>\n          <div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\" checked></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end\"><button>Discard</button><button class=\"primary\">Save limits</button></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pane stack\" id=\"keys\">\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content:space-between\"><h3>API keys</h3><button class=\"primary\" id=\"newk\">New key</button></div>\n      <div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:4px 16px\" id=\"klist\">\n        <div class=\"k\"><div><div>Storefront web</div><small class=\"faint mono\">ord_live_••••••••3f9a · read</small></div><small class=\"muted\">used 2 min ago</small><button class=\"rev\">Revoke</button></div>\n        <div class=\"k\"><div><div>Warehouse sync</div><small class=\"faint mono\">ord_live_••••••••c71e · read, write</small></div><small class=\"muted\">used 1 hr ago</small><button class=\"rev\">Revoke</button></div>\n        <div class=\"k\"><div><div>Analytics export</div><small class=\"faint mono\">ord_live_••••••••08bd · read</small></div><small class=\"muted\">used 12 days ago</small><button class=\"rev\">Revoke</button></div>\n        <div class=\"k\"><div><div>Local dev</div><small class=\"faint mono\">ord_test_••••••••a2d4 · read, write</small></div><small class=\"muted\">never used</small><button class=\"rev\">Revoke</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pane stack\" id=\"dz\">\n      <h3>Danger zone</h3>\n      <div class=\"card danger\" style=\"padding:4px 16px\">\n        <div class=\"dz\"><div><div>Pause the API</div><small class=\"faint\">Every route returns 503 until resumed</small></div><button id=\"pause\">Pause</button></div>\n        <div class=\"dz\"><div><div>Rotate all keys</div><small class=\"faint\">Revokes 4 keys and issues new ones</small></div><button>Rotate keys</button></div>\n        <div class=\"dz\" style=\"grid-template-columns:1fr\"><div><div>Delete all orders</div><small class=\"faint\">Wipes <code>data/orders.json</code>. Type <span class=\"mono\">orders-api</span> to confirm.</small></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><input id=\"conf\" placeholder=\"orders-api\" style=\"flex:1\"><button id=\"del\" disabled>Delete orders</button></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.nav button').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{\n  document.querySelectorAll('.nav button,.pane').forEach(e=>e.classList.remove('on'));\n  b.classList.add('on');document.getElementById(b.dataset.p).classList.add('on');});\nconst r=document.getElementById('rpm');r.oninput=()=>document.getElementById('rpmv').textContent=r.value;\nfunction wire(){document.querySelectorAll('.rev').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const k=b.closest('.k');\n  if(b.dataset.c){k.remove()}else{b.dataset.c=1;b.textContent='Confirm revoke'}});}\nwire();\ndocument.getElementById('newk').onclick=()=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='k';\n  const h=Math.random().toString(16).slice(2,6);\n  d.innerHTML=`<div><div>New key</div><small class=\"faint mono\">ord_live_••••••••${h} · read</small></div><small class=\"muted\">just created</small><button class=\"rev\">Revoke</button>`;\n  document.getElementById('klist').prepend(d);wire();};\ndocument.getElementById('conf').oninput=e=>document.getElementById('del').disabled=e.target.value!=='orders-api';\nconst p=document.getElementById('pause');p.onclick=()=>p.textContent=p.textContent==='Pause'?'Resume':'Pause';\n</script>"
