    "ask": "how should the 'order shipped' toast animate in? show me a few options",
    "after": "Here are four ways the \"Order shipped\" toast could come in. Hover over or focus a card to play it, and do it again to replay.",
    "code": "<style>\n.stage{position:relative;height:150px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-tertiary);border-radius:var(--border-radius-md);background:var(--color-background-secondary);overflow:hidden}\n.stage .bar{height:10px;margin:14px 14px 8px;width:45%;border-radius:4px;background:var(--color-background-tertiary)}\n.stage .bar.s{width:30%;margin-top:0}\n.toast{position:absolute;left:12px;right:12px;bottom:12px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:var(--border-radius-md);background:var(--color-background-primary);border:1px solid var(--color-border-secondary)}\n.toast.top{bottom:auto;top:12px}\n.ic{flex:none;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-background-tertiary);display:grid;place-items:center}\n.ic svg{width:12px;height:12px;stroke:var(--color-text-primary);fill:none;stroke-width:2.4;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.t1{font-weight:500;line-height:16px}.t2{font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}\n.tick{stroke-dasharray:14;stroke-dashoffset:0}\n\n[option]:hover .a-rise,[option]:focus .a-rise{animation:rise 240ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both}\n@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}}\n\n[option]:hover .a-spring,[option]:focus .a-spring{animation:spring 520ms cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) both}\n@keyframes spring{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-110%)}60%{opacity:1}}\n\n[option]:hover .a-slide,[option]:focus .a-slide{animation:slide 320ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both}\n@keyframes slide{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(110%)}}\n\n[option]:hover .a-pop,[option]:focus .a-pop{animation:pop 380ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both}\n[option]:hover .a-pop .ic,[option]:focus .a-pop .ic{animation:icon 420ms 140ms cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) both}\n[option]:hover .a-pop .tick,[option]:focus .a-pop .tick{animation:draw 260ms 360ms ease-out both}\n@keyframes pop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px) scale(.94)}}\n@keyframes icon{from{transform:scale(0)}}\n@keyframes draw{from{stroke-dashoffset:14}}\n</style>\n<canopy-pick question=\"How should the order shipped toast enter?\" message=\"Animate the order shipped toast with {choice}\" button=\"Use {choice}\">\n<div class=\"grid\" style=\"--min: 150px\">\n  <div option=\"Rise\" hint=\"12px up + fade, 240ms ease-out\" recommended>\n    <div class=\"stage\"><div class=\"bar\"></div><div class=\"bar s\"></div>\n      <div class=\"toast a-rise\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7\"/></svg></div><div><div class=\"t1\">Order shipped</div><div class=\"t2\">Arrives Friday, Nov 21</div></div></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div option=\"Drop from top\" hint=\"Spring with overshoot, 520ms\">\n    <div class=\"stage\"><div class=\"bar\"></div><div class=\"bar s\"></div>\n      <div class=\"toast top a-spring\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7\"/></svg></div><div><div class=\"t1\">Order shipped</div><div class=\"t2\">Arrives Friday, Nov 21</div></div></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div option=\"Slide from right\" hint=\"Full width in, 320ms expo-out\">\n    <div class=\"stage\"><div class=\"bar\"></div><div class=\"bar s\"></div>\n      <div class=\"toast a-slide\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7\"/></svg></div><div><div class=\"t1\">Order shipped</div><div class=\"t2\">Arrives Friday, Nov 21</div></div></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div option=\"Pop + check\" hint=\"Scale in, then the check draws, ~620ms\">\n    <div class=\"stage\"><div class=\"bar\"></div><div class=\"bar s\"></div>\n      <div class=\"toast a-pop\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7\"/></svg></div><div><div class=\"t1\">Order shipped</div><div class=\"t2\">Arrives Friday, Nov 21</div></div></div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</canopy-pick>"
